onvictions</strong>\u00a0and alter the foundations of entire systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.poster.avif?t=1767776891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.webm?t=1767776891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No pay-to-win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a long time player of Cardbattlers and online games, I'm dreading pay to win elements. One Last Sacrifice will never sell player power. The game will be buy to play during early access and become free to play with V1.0 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early players will receive additional inventory space over players joining at a later stage of the game.<br>In the long run, OLS is intended to become a seasonal game, financed via Inventory Space selling, cosmetics and potentially Story-DLC Content.</p>","developers":["MegaMaw Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/d7d69c8b15b01507a568a4ada45746bc8b92173a/header.jpg?t=1767776891","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4019040/1601542341/684eeefa5ac2c32ffccafcd509efd8b220e93a6a/1760343581/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760345127","dash_h264":"https://vid